# clasp pushes everything under rootDir unless listed here. Only three files
# belong in the Apps Script project: the manifest, the server code, and the
# generated sidebar. Everything else is build tooling or documentation, and
# pushing it would put the bundler source and the listing copy into a project
# that goes to Google for OAuth review.
**/**
!appsscript.json
!Code.gs
!Sidebar.html
